{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning everyone. I'm Maj. Carter, the S-3. Before I can publish the final staffing roster for the coordination cell during the four-day field exercise, we need to run our routine pre-exercise qualification scrub with personnel, logistics, and signal staff. We've got three desks to fill — partner liaison, POL accountability, and movement control — and three available personnel: Sgt Malik, Cpl Ortiz, and Spc Vega. Each desk requires a current applicable qualification. Let's start by confirming what qualifications each of these three soldiers currently holds, so we can match them to the right desks. Who has that information?"}
```

